        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid, modify the carried piece's shape, color, and rotation as needed, and step onto every goal cell while all three attributes match each goal's requirements. Completing all goals in each level advances to the next level, and all levels must be completed to win.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina. If stamina reaches zero, one life is lost and stamina resets; losing all lives ends the game. Walls block movement, so blocked_directions must be checked before every move. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle orange to blue to green to red and back to orange, and rotation modifiers turn the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. A goal activates only when shape, color, and rotation all match, and stepping onto an activated goal completes it."
